{"abstract":[{"text":"The attributes element contains musical information that typically changes on measure boundaries. This","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"includes key and time signatures, clefs, transpositions, and staving. When attributes are changed mid-measure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it affects the music in score order, not in MusicXML document order.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/Directive-swift.struct"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/init(footnote:level:divisions:key:time:staves:partSymbol:instruments:clef:staffDetails:content:directive:measureStyle:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/clef","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/content-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/directive-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/divisions","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/footnote","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/instruments","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/key","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/level","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/measureStyle","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/partSymbol","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/staffDetails","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/staves","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/time"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAttributes\/Content-swift.enum"],"anchor":"E